$Descr A0 46811 33110
Sheet 1 1
Title "DM-02 private-output flash array"
Date "2026-11-14"
Rev "FR1"
Comp "DM-02"
Comment1 "Eight SST39SF040 PLCC32 devices; four word banks; WE tied inactive high."
Comment2 "Private outputs, buffered address groups and two-level AHCT157 bank selection."
Comment3 "100 us power-up-to-read; physical programmer, startup supply and PCB qualification pending."
Comment4 ""
$EndDescr
$Comp
L DM02-Flash:SST39SF040 U1
U 1 1 69E00000
P 2000 1900
F 0 "U1" H 2100 2200 50 0000 L CNN
F 1 "SST39SF040-70-4I-NHE" H 2100 2100 50 0000 L CNN
F 2 "Package_LCC:PLCC-32_THT-Socket" H 2000 1900 50 0001 C CNN
	1 2000 1900
	1 0 0 -1
$EndComp
